# Secrets / local env
.env

# Node. No trailing slash on node_modules: CLAUDE.md tells a worktree that needs
# deps to SYMLINK node_modules from a long-lived worktree rather than run `npm ci`
# (whose agent-browser postinstall clobbers the host's binary). A `dir/` pattern
# matches directories ONLY, so the prescribed symlink showed up as untracked and one
# `git add -A` from committing a link pointing outside the repo.
web/node_modules
web/dist/

# Go
api/server
*.test

